pairdrop-rs
===========

A fork of PairDrop (https://github.com/schlagmichdoch/PairDrop) by schlagmichdoch.

The web client under `public/` is PairDrop's, carried over and modified. The Node.js signaling
server was replaced with a Rust one under `src/`, and removed from the tree in 2.0.0 once the
port had been verified against it frame for frame. It remains in history at `fb743eb:server/`.

